itle":"`digest mismatch` on download","comments":162,"created_at":"2023-10-28T17:47:23Z"},{"number":3368,"title":"Reranking models","comments":109,"created_at":"2024-03-27T07:41:15Z"},{"number":5245,"title":"Allow importing multi-file GGUF models","comments":110,"created_at":"2024-06-23T21:45:41Z"},{"number":2006,"title":"Rate limit download speed on pulling new models","comments":91,"created_at":"2024-01-15T15:02:22Z"},{"number":1590,"title":"Add support for Intel Arc GPUs","comments":76,"created_at":"2023-12-18T23:25:37Z"},{"number":162,"title":"Don't automatically start on startup / have an option to disable this","comments":70,"created_at":"2023-07-21T13:57:28Z"},{"number":5186,"title":"AMD Ryzen NPU support","comments":66,"created_at":"2024-06-20T15:48:13Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"v0.40.16","tag":"v0.40.16","published_at":"2026-11-09T18:21:19Z","body":"## Ripple Preview\r\n\r\n[Ripple Preview](https://ollama.com/library/ripple-preview) from Ricursive Intelligence is a 65B dense model built for agentic coding.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nollama run ripple-preview\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n- Qwen3.8 Flash Next uses about 27 GiB less memory on Apple silicon\r\n- `ollama launch claude` always routes Claude Code to the selected model\r\n- `ollama launch` explains when a cloud model has been retired\r\n- `/v1/responses` respects `truncation` and no longer silently truncates by default\r\n- `/v1/models` returns an empty list instead of `null` when no models are installed\r\n- CUDA 13.5 support for Windows on ARM\r\n- Updated llama.cpp\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.15...v0.40.16","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Llama.cpp supports Vulkan. why doesn't Ollama?","url":"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/5059","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=42886680","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2025-01-31","points":217,"comments":228},{"title":"Ollama viol